  "case_id": "doors_windows_storey__mall",
  "rule": "Every door and window must be assigned to the same building storey as the wall it is placed in, and must not be an orphan (a door or window with no host element at all).\n\nA door or window fills an opening that voids a host element - its wall. It violates the rule when (a) it has no host element, or (b) the storey containing it differs from the storey containing its host. If either storey cannot be determined the element cannot be judged: label it ALERT, and do NOT report it as a violation.\n\nReport the GlobalId of every element (modelled as IfcDoor or IfcWindow) that does NOT satisfy this requirement.",
